<title>USA: Pacific Sunwear Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Pacific Sunwear Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ANAHEIM, Calif. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>(000s omitted, except share data)</p>
<p>			  Fourth Quarter Ended  Twelve Months Ended</p>
<p>			  1997	   1996	 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net Sales	   $49,807	$36,404   $155,262   $112,921</p>
<p> Gross margin	 16,752	 10,629     49,135     32,133</p>
<p>Selling, G&amp;A expense</p>
<p>			  11,321	  7,912     37,126     27,996</p>
<p> Operating income    5,431	  2,717     12,009	4,137</p>
<p> Interest income	  99		9	  237	   63</p>
<p>Income before taxes  </p>
<p>			   5,530	  2,726     12,246	4,200</p>
<p> Income tax expense  2,173	  1,025	4,834	1,576</p>
<p> Net income	    3,357	  1,701	7,412	2,624</p>
<p>Net income per share*</p>
<p>			     .40	    .21	  .89	  .33</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>   outstanding*  8,394,821    8,044,598  8,303,078  8,023,007</p>
<p>* Per share amounts and shares outstanding have been adjusted to reflect a 3-for-2 stock split effected on October 9, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
